  "zh": "# 全美航班罕见停飞4.5小时，英伟达股价创近年新低，DeepSeek搅局API市场\n## 全球科技\n- **全美航班停飞**：9·11后首次全国地面停飞暴露FAA系统脆弱性，4.5小时瘫痪引发对关键基础设施韧性的深度担忧。\n- **英伟达股价创新低**：连跌创18个月最差周表现，董事套现传闻叠加AI泡沫担忧，市场开始重估算力巨头估值上限。\n- **DeepSeek发布全家桶API**：全模型开放且定价激进，直接搅动大模型应用层成本结构，开发者迁移成本大幅降低。\n## 产业动向\n- **星舰十五助推器回收失败**：筷子夹火箭再次折戟转为海上溅落，SpaceX快速迭代节奏下的硬着陆凸显可复用可靠性挑战。\n- **阿里分拆平头哥上市**：芯片业务独立融资加速产业链自主可控，估值百亿级IPO将成港股半导体风向标。\n## 社会热点\n- **博士妈妈三年生三娃**：极限生育挑战学术与家庭双轨叙事，折射高知女性在评价体系与生育政策夹缝中的真实困境。\n- **无人健身房开1300家**：轻资产加盟模式疯狂跑马圈地，但会员留存与设备维护的长尾成本恐成泡沫破裂导火索。\n## 国际视野\n- **APEC中国年新机遇**：中国推动自贸区网络升级与数字经济合作，在地缘碎片化中为亚太提供确定性增长引擎。",
  "en": "# US nationwide ground stop halts flights for 4.5 hours; Nvidia hits 18-month low; DeepSeek disrupts API market\n## Global Tech\n- **US Ground Stop Order**: First national ground stop since 9/11 exposes FAA system fragility; 4.5-hour paralysis raises alarm over critical infrastructure resilience.\n- **Nvidia 18-Month Low**: Worst weekly drop since 2022 amid insider selling rumors and AI bubble fears; market reassesses ceiling for compute giant.\n- **DeepSeek API Suite**: Aggressive pricing on all models shakes up LLM app layer economics, slashing migration costs for developers.\n## Industry Moves\n- **Starship Booster Fail**: Mechazilla catch missed again, fallback to splashdown; SpaceX's rapid iteration hits reliability wall for full reuse.\n- **Alibaba Chip IPO**: Chip unit's independent listing accelerates supply-chain sovereignty; multi-billion dollar HK debut to benchmark semiconductor sentiment.\n## Social Buzz\n- **PhD Mom 3 Kids**: Extreme fertility case spotlights high-educated women squeezed between academic metrics and pro-natalist policies.\n- **Unmanned Gym 5yr 1300**: Asset-light franchise blitz scales fast, but retention and maintenance long-tail costs may burst the bubble.\n## World View\n- **APEC China Year**: China pushes FTAAP upgrade and digital cooperation, offering growth certainty amid geopolitical fragmentation."
